## WHAT WE HAVE

### Racks built — 34, all confirmed loading in Live

Location: `~/Music/Ableton/User Library/- Drum Racks/`
Samples stay in `~/Desktop/SAMPLES MAC/<set>/renamed/` — racks point there by relative + absolute path.

| Set | Racks | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Drum Machines | 26 | one per machine, max 32 pads; YamahaRX5 I (studio) + II (tape) |
| Eitan Kicks | 6 | by note: E 18 · F 34 · F# 31 · G 28 · G# 22 · Other 27 — nothing cut |
| Splice | 2 | Tambourines 17 · Rides 22 |

Pad naming: `Type [Note] NN Machine` — e.g. `Conga [C#] 02 LM1`, `Kick [F] 14 SoftSat`. No bracket = no pitch found.
All pads start at C1. All at -6 dBFS. Originals never touched.

Two template bugs found 4 Sep when Amir loaded a rack: RelativePathType must be 1 with real size + CRC-16/0x8005,
and ReceivingNote is stored as 128-MIDI. Both fixed in the tool. "Valid XML" is not verification; loading in Live is.

