## RULES IN FORCE

- Originals are never renamed or moved. The tool copies.
- Max 32 pads per rack (two pages of 16).
- One-shots only. No loops in racks.
- Pitch marker is `[C#]` in brackets, real sharp sign, no octave. Type first, machine last.
- Pitch only shown at 80%+ confidence.
- **Every delete is verified against all projects, counted in songs not files, before it happens.**
- Nothing moves without your word.
